            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Introducing <strong><a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/desktop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Unsloth Desktop</a></strong>, the first desktop app to run and train models. Free and open-source for macOS, Windows and Linux. <a href=\"https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> \u2022 <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/download\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Download</a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/desktop\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/unslothai/notebooks/refs/heads/main/assets/unsloth-qwen3-8.png\" width=\"350\" alt=\"Introducing Unsloth Desktop\"></a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Train MoEs - DeepSeek, GLM, Qwen and gpt-oss 12x faster with 35% less VRAM. <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/new/faster-moe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blog</a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Ultra Long-Context Reinforcement Learning is here with 7x more context windows! <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/new/grpo-long-context\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blog</a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">New in Reinforcement Learning: <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/new/fp8-reinforcement-learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FP8 RL</a> \u2022 <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/new/vision-reinforcement-learning-vlm-rl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Vision RL</a> \u2022 <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/basics/memory-efficient-rl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Standby</a> \u2022 <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/new/gpt-oss-reinforcement-learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">gpt-oss RL</a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Visit our docs for all our <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/docs/get-started/unsloth-model-catalog\" rel=\"noopener nore