            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"data-prep\">Data Prep</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><a name=\"Data\"></a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">We directly leverage <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/willccbb/4676755236bb08cab5f4e54a0475d6fb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@willccbb</a> for data prep and all reward functions. You are free to create your own!</span></span>"
