            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">And let's run the trainer! If you scroll up, you'll see a table of rewards. The goal is to see the <code>reward</code> column increase!</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You might have to wait 150 to 200 steps for any action. You'll probably get 0 reward for the first 100 steps. Please be patient!</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Step</th>\n<th>Training Loss</th>\n<th>reward</th>\n<th>reward_std</th>\n<th>completion_length</th>\n<th>kl</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.000000</td>\n<td>0.125000</td>\n<td>0.000000</td>\n<td>200.000000</td>\n<td>0.000000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.000000</td>\n<td>0.072375</td>\n<td>0.248112</td>\n<td>200.000000</td>\n<td>0.000000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0.000000</td>\n<td>-0.079000</td>\n<td>0.163776</td>\n<td>182.500000</td>\n<td>0.000005</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span>"
