            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Our reasoning model is much better - it's not always correct, since we only trained it for an hour or so - it'll be better if we extend the sequence length and train for longer!</span></span>"
